    <data key="evidence">Accept: Accept: identity theft, impersonation and identity-related access risks. Limits: Multiple supporting discussions do not establish incident frequency or independent empirical confirmation of particular cases.</data>
    <data key="edge_origin">author_reviewed_k11_20261001</data>
